{
  "slug": "04-navigation",
  "model": "fish-speech-1.5",
  "generatedAt": "2026-11-14T02:32:20.307Z",
  "segmentCount": 58,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "白话版（先看这个）",
      "hash": "6977374ca2a45355",
      "audio": "seg00.mp3",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 2.247
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "解决什么问题 ：一个 App 不只有一页。章节列表要点进答题页，答题结束要返回，还要把关卡编号带过去；Navigation 就是管理这些页面和返回栈的容器。",
      "hash": "566a9d72909acf9c",
      "audio": "seg01.mp3",
      "start": 2.247,
      "duration": 10.919
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "一句话经验 ：一个 Navigation 管一个 NavPathStack ，目标页包 NavDestination ，参数用普通对象传，返回交给栈。",
      "hash": "fd1cd2846c5a67a7",
      "audio": "seg02.mp3",
      "start": 13.166,
      "duration": 10.423
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "常见坑 1 ：只写 NavDestination ，外层没有对应的 Navigation ，页面无法按预期入栈。",
      "hash": "ab7e9e25e850bead",
      "audio": "seg03.mp3",
      "start": 23.589,
      "duration": 7.314
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "常见坑 2 ：从父组件新建一份栈，子页面又新建一份，结果 pop() 操作的不是同一条栈。",
      "hash": "cc43238cb6cb8ad2",
      "audio": "seg04.mp3",
      "start": 30.903,
      "duration": 9.874
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "常见坑 3 ：在目标组件里读全局旧参数，而不是从当前导航上下文读取，连续跳转后拿到上一页数据。",
      "hash": "34b5171cfd79c9c9",
      "audio": "seg05.mp3",
      "start": 40.777,
      "duration": 9.9
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "常见坑 4 ：每个按钮都手写 router.pushUrl ，页面关系和转场越写越散；新项目应统一走 Navigation。",
      "hash": "026d9d3eb1fa23cc",
      "audio": "seg06.mp3",
      "start": 50.678,
      "duration": 9.639
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "必记 1 ： pushPathByName 入栈， pop 出栈， replacePathByName 替换当前页。",
      "hash": "607a7e80751987a5",
      "audio": "seg07.mp3",
      "start": 60.317,
      "duration": 8.986
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "必记 2 ： NavDestination 是页面容器，不是另一个 Navigation 。",
      "hash": "9968b0a957eb80fc",
      "audio": "seg08.mp3",
      "start": 69.303,
      "duration": 5.303
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "必记 3 ：销毁清理看组件的 aboutToDisappear ，页面显隐不要等同于组件销毁。",
      "hash": "59a9b7eea8fdd4f8",
      "audio": "seg09.mp3",
      "start": 74.606,
      "duration": 6.792
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "本章你会学到",
      "hash": "2d47d26230218cbb",
      "audio": "seg10.mp3",
      "start": 81.398,
      "duration": 1.829
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Navigation 与 NavDestination 各自负责什么。",
      "hash": "c74d850f5d8a237e",
      "audio": "seg11.mp3",
      "start": 83.226,
      "duration": 5.486
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "怎样共享 NavPathStack，跳转并传递关卡 ID。",
      "hash": "479f4c0187a64e9d",
      "audio": "seg12.mp3",
      "start": 88.712,
      "duration": 3.866
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "怎样返回、替换页面以及设置自定义转场。",
      "hash": "6ec4828bb5da049f",
      "audio": "seg13.mp3",
      "start": 92.578,
      "duration": 5.355
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "页面显示、隐藏与组件创建、销毁的区别。",
      "hash": "b6076a4f39f793c3",
      "audio": "seg14.mp3",
      "start": 97.933,
      "duration": 3.788
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "为什么新项目优先 Navigation，而不是继续堆 router 调用。",
      "hash": "7f1eaaace56317b1",
      "audio": "seg15.mp3",
      "start": 101.721,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "1. 先建立页面地图",
      "hash": "c025f1a1e9287106",
      "audio": "seg16.mp3",
      "start": 106.841,
      "duration": 1.881
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Navigation是导航根容器；NavDestination是目标页容器；NavPathStack保存目标页组成的路径。",
      "hash": "a27a57b657a70ae2",
      "audio": "seg17.mp3",
      "start": 108.722,
      "duration": 7.079
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "栈顶就是用户看到的页面。点返回时弹出一项，不是把整份页面数组重新渲染。",
      "hash": "b7d46fa93c4ee93f",
      "audio": "seg18.mp3",
      "start": 115.801,
      "duration": 6.296
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "（本节含表格，建议查看原文）",
      "hash": "c6f7ee60d35a4684",
      "audio": "seg19.mp3",
      "start": 122.096,
      "duration": 2.664
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "2. 在根页面持有路由栈",
      "hash": "48a9fe4170768d92",
      "audio": "seg20.mp3",
      "start": 124.761,
      "duration": 3.631
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "下面用系统路由表模式：根页面持有栈，详情页的构建函数注册到路由表。这里先关注页面关系。",
      "hash": "6d1859361a9a4978",
      "audio": "seg21.mp3",
      "start": 128.392,
      "duration": 8.464
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "QuizParam 是明确的接口，参数保持 JSON 友好的普通对象。不要把组件实例、网络连接或回调塞进路由参数：这些对象不适合作为页面状态恢复的数据。系统路由表和自定义 navDestination 构建器选择一种组织方式，避免重复注册。",
      "hash": "d27e4fb64b26b578",
      "audio": "seg22.mp3",
      "start": 136.856,
      "duration": 18.233
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "3. 目标页读取本次参数",
      "hash": "dd18e82b504dc587",
      "audio": "seg23.mp3",
      "start": 155.089,
      "duration": 3.971
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "目标页把内容包在 NavDestination 中，并从 onReady 保存当前上下文里的栈。使用系统路由表时，构建函数的 param 是本次传入的数据。",
      "hash": "9f38851ae8bc54c9",
      "audio": "seg24.mp3",
      "start": 159.06,
      "duration": 12.8
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "onReady 表示目标页已经准备好，不等于每次重新显示都会执行。若数据来自路由构建函数，要确保该参数确实进入组件；若使用 getParamByName ，也要按目标页名读取并校验类型。",
      "hash": "7ea88257a4a78850",
      "audio": "seg25.mp3",
      "start": 171.86,
      "duration": 12.565
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "只传恢复页面所需的稳定数据，例如 levelId 。整份题库应由仓库按 ID 加载，而不是在多层页面之间复制。连续进入不同关卡时，也要确认组件收到的是本次参数。",
      "hash": "52bcee8349991189",
      "audio": "seg26.mp3",
      "start": 184.424,
      "duration": 13.714
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "4. 入栈、替换与返回结果",
      "hash": "9c0553dd8a8e73dc",
      "audio": "seg27.mp3",
      "start": 198.139,
      "duration": 5.224
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "闯关完成后进入下一关，通常用替换而不是继续压栈：这样用户按返回不会又回到“已完成的结算页”。",
      "hash": "f0df7adf4af3c240",
      "audio": "seg28.mp3",
      "start": 203.363,
      "duration": 7.576
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "pushPathByName ：保留当前页，适合列表进入详情。",
      "hash": "256f7bdf8782dacd",
      "audio": "seg29.mp3",
      "start": 210.939,
      "duration": 4.023
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "replacePathByName ：替换当前目标，适合结算后进入下一关。",
      "hash": "39cfd497389888c6",
      "audio": "seg30.mp3",
      "start": 214.962,
      "duration": 5.59
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "pop ：移除栈顶；返回前若存在未保存作答，应先提示或先保存。",
      "hash": "14b18b9bdb0f931f",
      "audio": "seg31.mp3",
      "start": 220.552,
      "duration": 5.695
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "clear ：清空整个栈，只用于确有必要的主流程重置，不是普通返回按钮。 系统路由表让页面名称与构建函数集中配置；组件里只写稳定的页面名和业务参数。修改页面目录时，不必在几十个按钮中搜索字符串路径。",
      "hash": "ddba939c5887402d",
      "audio": "seg32.mp3",
      "start": 226.247,
      "duration": 17.293
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "5. 页面生命周期与组件生命周期",
      "hash": "11973beeb8f45d04",
      "audio": "seg33.mp3",
      "start": 243.54,
      "duration": 6.74
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "这是两套相关但不同的观察角度：",
      "hash": "1a7eaf24d238e28e",
      "audio": "seg34.mp3",
      "start": 250.279,
      "duration": 2.612
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "新页入栈后，旧页往往只是隐藏，并未销毁。因此：",
      "hash": "bdf294953e357ccd",
      "audio": "seg35.mp3",
      "start": 252.891,
      "duration": 4.754
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "每次回到页面都要刷新的数据，可放在 onShown 。",
      "hash": "798eeb8727889ba1",
      "audio": "seg36.mp3",
      "start": 257.646,
      "duration": 3.082
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "只需创建时加载一次的数据，可放在 aboutToAppear 。",
      "hash": "b2bd32eb8829d535",
      "audio": "seg37.mp3",
      "start": 260.728,
      "duration": 3.866
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "定时器、订阅和监听器，应在配对的清理时机释放；组件不再需要时，在 aboutToDisappear 清理。",
      "hash": "beac9ade29717553",
      "audio": "seg38.mp3",
      "start": 264.594,
      "duration": 7.811
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "aboutToDisappear 不修改状态，也不依赖耗时异步操作来完成关键保存。",
      "hash": "369110737a6a20b6",
      "audio": "seg39.mp3",
      "start": 272.405,
      "duration": 7.027
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "6. 转场：让页面关系可感知",
      "hash": "69adf8b4985c94d2",
      "audio": "seg40.mp3",
      "start": 279.432,
      "duration": 4.336
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "默认转场已经能表达“进入”和“返回”。需要共享视觉元素或特殊方向时，再使用 customNavContentTransition 自定义 NavDestination 转场。 自定义转场应回答三个问题：进入怎样开始、退出怎样结束、交互被取消时怎样恢复。优先使用透明度和位移，避免长时间动画阻塞答题操作。转场对象由页面统一注册，不要在每个按钮里修改组件坐标来模拟跳转；真正的页面状态仍由 NavPathStack 管理。",
      "hash": "967983ede90352d4",
      "audio": "seg41.mp3",
      "start": 283.768,
      "duration": 30.668
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "7. router 为什么不再作为新项目首选",
      "hash": "856c0042552f44c1",
      "audio": "seg42.mp3",
      "start": 314.436,
      "duration": 5.224
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "router.pushUrl 可以完成传统页面跳转，但复杂场景下，页面栈、模式化导航和转场由 Navigation 体系统一表达更清楚。",
      "hash": "4faa2f145b451505",
      "audio": "seg43.mp3",
      "start": 319.66,
      "duration": 8.751
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "（本节含表格，建议查看原文）",
      "hash": "c6f7ee60d35a4684",
      "audio": "seg44.mp3",
      "start": 328.411,
      "duration": 3.03
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "实现一个根页面和一个答题目标页：点击按钮传入 levelId = \"04\" ，答题页显示该 ID，并能通过当前导航栈返回。另说明为什么不在答题页重新 new NavPathStack() 。",
      "hash": "da965947a3b4087c",
      "audio": "seg45.mp3",
      "start": 331.442,
      "duration": 12.696
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "本章小结",
      "hash": "59955b2934432bfc",
      "audio": "seg46.mp3",
      "start": 344.137,
      "duration": 1.593
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Navigation 提供作用域，NavDestination 承载目标页，NavPathStack 管路径。",
      "hash": "dcc22e4b6b069f50",
      "audio": "seg47.mp3",
      "start": 345.731,
      "duration": 6.296
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "用 pushPathByName 传稳定、可序列化的小参数；返回与替换要符合业务流程。",
      "hash": "09a35345d3a0b1f1",
      "audio": "seg48.mp3",
      "start": 352.026,
      "duration": 6.426
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "页面隐藏不等于组件销毁，加载和清理要选择正确生命周期。",
      "hash": "cb20cf4bda03e56d",
      "audio": "seg49.mp3",
      "start": 358.452,
      "duration": 5.825
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "自定义转场只改变过渡表现，不代替导航栈。",
      "hash": "00e662834c672423",
      "audio": "seg50.mp3",
      "start": 364.278,
      "duration": 4.101
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "新项目主流程采用 Navigation，不把 router 当成默认方案。",
      "hash": "9468ce8bdb2d0d37",
      "audio": "seg51.mp3",
      "start": 368.379,
      "duration": 5.956
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "一个根导航、一条共享栈、一页一个目的地；参数随本次跳转走，资源随生命周期清。",
      "hash": "2654b455abe27f90",
      "audio": "seg52.mp3",
      "start": 374.335,
      "duration": 8.411
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "延伸阅读",
      "hash": "e558bd3b8ec12c95",
      "audio": "seg53.mp3",
      "start": 382.746,
      "duration": 1.28
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Navigation 导航架构",
      "hash": "edf066a841aba907",
      "audio": "seg54.mp3",
      "start": 384.026,
      "duration": 3.814
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Navigation 页面跳转",
      "hash": "92aa8c8006f05bc4",
      "audio": "seg55.mp3",
      "start": 387.84,
      "duration": 2.247
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Router 页面路由",
      "hash": "59c9fd5243ccd63c",
      "audio": "seg56.mp3",
      "start": 390.087,
      "duration": 1.933
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Stage 模型入门",
      "hash": "4a8a4dbc13afb57d",
      "audio": "seg57.mp3",
      "start": 392.02,
      "duration": 1.933
    }
  ],
